* LT3094 Negative LDO Regulator -7V to -5V
.lib LT3094.sub

* Power Supply
V1 IN 0 -7

* Load (10mA light load)
Rload OUT 0 500

* Input and Output Capacitors
Cin IN 0 10u
Cout OUT 0 10u

* SET Pin Configuration (100uA * 50k = 5V drop -> -5V output)
Rset SET 0 50k
Cset SET 0 10p

* LT3094 Subcircuit Instantiation
* Pin Order: IN EN/UVLO PG ILIM VIOC PGFB SET GND OUTS OUT
* Unused optional pins (PG, ILIM, VIOC, PGFB) are safely tied to IN.
* EN/UVLO tied to 0 (GND) to enable the part (GND is +7V relative to IN).
X1 IN 0 IN IN IN IN SET 0 OUT OUT LT3094

* Analysis Directive
.tran 10m

.end
